<section id="experiencia" class="scroll-mt-24">
  <div class="reveal">
    <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-muted-foreground">
      04 — Experiência
    </p>
    <h2
      class="mt-3 font-display text-3xl font-medium tracking-tight md:text-4xl"
    >
      Onde o trabalho aconteceu
    </h2>
    <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-base leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
      Da interface ao motor de análise: cada posição abaixo mostra o tipo de
      problema que assumi e as tecnologias que sustentaram a entrega.
    </p>
  </div>

  <ol class="relative mt-10 space-y-8 border-l border-border pl-6 md:pl-8">
    {
      roles.map((role) => (
        <li class="reveal relative">
          <span
            class="absolute top-1.5 -left-[1.7rem] h-3 w-3 rounded-full border border-accent bg-background md:-left-[2.2rem]"
            aria-hidden="true"
          />
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline sm:justify-between">
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-display text-xl md:text-2xl">{role.title}</h3>
              <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-accent-link">{role.company}</p>
            </div>
            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">{role.period}</p>
          </div>
          <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
            {role.points.map((point) => (
              <li>{point}</li>
            ))}
          </ul>
          <ul class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            {role.stack.map((tech) => (
              <li class="rounded-full border border-border px-3 py-1 text-xs text-muted-foreground">
                {tech}
              </li>
            ))}
          </ul>
